{"suttaId":"tha-ap190","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7160,7175],"vripara":"46"},"segments":{"tha-ap190:0.3":"Tikaṇṇipupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap190:1.1":"“Devabhūto ahaṃ santo, accharāhi purakkhato;","tha-ap190:1.3":"Pubbakammaṃ saritvāna, buddhaseṭṭhaṃ anussariṃ.","tha-ap190:2.1":"“Tikaṇṇipupphaṃ [kiṃkaṇipupphaṃ (ka.)] paggayha, sakaṃ cittaṃ pasādayiṃ;","tha-ap190:2.3":"Buddhamhi abhiropesiṃ, vipassimhi narāsabhe.","tha-ap190:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap190:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap190:4.1":"“Tesattatimhito kappe, caturāsuṃ ramuttamā;","tha-ap190:4.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap190:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap190:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā tikaṇṇipupphiyo [kiṃkaṇikapupphiyo (ka.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap190:7.1":"Tikaṇṇipupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
